# Flutter UI

- Providers: Auth, Audio, Bluetooth, Overlay, Settings, Permission, Studio.
- No heavy logic in `build`; call provider methods.
- ScreenUtil everywhere for size/spacing/typography.
- Overlay: show when app paused/background; hide on resume; survive clear-from-recents via FGS.
- Settings Demo Beta toggles both `SettingsProvider` and `AudioProvider.setBetaMode`.
- Home: greeting/goodbye buttons → native via `AudioProvider.play*ViaNative`.
